OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fand light winds during the evening
OL,7,Fwill allow some mist or fog patches to
OL,8,Fbecome more widespread across the
OL,9,Fregion. Some rain and drizzle reaching
OL,10,Fnorthwestern parts by Sunday morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FMisty with band of rain and
OL,13,Fdrizzle spreading south and east with
OL,14,Fclearer conditions following in
OL,15,Fafternoon, when some bright spells
OL,16,Fmight develop later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
